{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52238","headline":"澄州无虞县清泰乡都万里六合坚固大宅诗（五言） · 韦敬辨","name":"澄州无虞县清泰乡都万里六合坚固大宅诗（五言）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"近濆纵横越，募岱去来阑。\n千岑爲□绝，三峡以衢难。\n庶捷犹求跨，郡攘□能观。\n苦固於兹第，永世保无残。\n（见广西上林县麒麟山唐永淳元年立《六合坚固大宅颂》碑附。\n转录自《广西少数民族地区石刻碑文集》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦敬辨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}